  <div style="font-size:8px;color:#6B6B6B;margin-bottom:12px;">The steps above describe the full scope of the standard service. Anything not listed &mdash; or not itemised on page 1 &mdash; is out of scope and will be quoted separately.</div>

  <!-- ═══ TERMS & CONDITIONS — UGANDA ═══ -->
