  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 5px 0 0;width:33%;font-size:8.5px;color:#444;line-height:1.4;">
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">1. Agreement &amp; Acceptance:</b> This quotation together with these Terms &amp; Conditions is the entire agreement between the customer and DishNet Africa Ltd and supersedes all prior discussions. No verbal statement or promise binds DishNet unless confirmed in writing by an authorised DishNet representative.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">2. Currency &amp; Pricing:</b> All prices in Ugandan Shillings (UGX). {% if totals.taxes|length > 0 %}VAT is itemised in the totals on page 1.{% else %}No VAT is charged on this quotation.{% endif %} Prices may change with 30 days' notice. Any new or increased government tax, levy or regulatory fee introduced after acceptance may be passed on at cost.</div>
