        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">8. Service &amp; Support:</b> DishNet provides installation, account management and after-sales support on +256 705 993 348. Support covers the DishNet-supplied installation and account; the customer's own devices, internal networks and third-party equipment are outside scope and chargeable on request.</div>
