        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">10. Fair Use:</b> Lawful personal or business use only; no resale of the service without a written agreement. DishNet may suspend the service immediately and without refund where it is used unlawfully, and the customer remains fully responsible for all use of the connection.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">11. Cancellation &amp; Refunds:</b> Cancel or pause with notice before the next billing date. Fees for a started service month, and installation fees once work has begun, are not refundable. Delivered equipment is not returnable for refund unless defective on arrival.</div>
