      </td>
      <td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 0 5px;width:33%;font-size:8.5px;color:#444;line-height:1.4;">
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">13. Liability:</b> To the maximum extent permitted by law, DishNet is not liable for indirect, incidental or consequential loss, including loss of business, profits, data or downtime. DishNet's total aggregate liability under this agreement is capped at the service fees paid by the customer in the 3 months before the claim arose.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">14. Force Majeure:</b> DishNet is not liable for failure or delay caused by events beyond its reasonable control, including weather, power failure, satellite or network outage, acts of government or regulators, civil unrest or natural disaster.</div>
